message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "High-Order Markov Blanket Discovery"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying the paper "High-Order Markov Blanket Discovery via a
  k-Order Relaxation of the Faithfulness Assumption" (UAI 2026): the kOMB
  algorithm and its Rust/PyO3 discovery engine.
type: software
license: MIT
